      en: ["The fountain was erected in 1900 in honor of Otto von Bismarck.", "It is located in the historical government district of Buea.", "The monument was crafted from local stone and imported materials.", "The fountain was part of the city's first central water supply system.", "Otto von Bismarck was the initiator of the Berlin Congo Conference in 1884.", "Nearby are other German buildings such as the post office and the castle."],
