      hu: ["A palota több mint 400 éve a Bafut-dinasztia székhelye.", "Az 'Achum' szentély a komplexum legrégebbi fennmaradt épülete.", "1907-ben a német csapatok felgyújtották a palotát.", "A helyszín 2006-ban került fel az UNESCO várományosi listájára.", "Az éves Abin-szertartást általában decemberben tartják meg.", "Bafut fontos bázisa volt a brit antropológiai kutatásoknak."],
      ro: ["Palatul este sediul dinastiei Bafut de peste 400 de ani.", "Sanctuarul 'Achum' este cea mai veche clădire păstrată din complex.", "În anul 1907, palatul a fost incendiat de către trupele germane.", "Situl a fost inclus pe lista indicativă UNESCO în anul 2006.", "Ceremonia anuală Abin are loc de obicei în luna decembrie.", "Bafut a fost un punct important pentru antropologii britanici."],
      en: ["The palace has been the seat of the Bafut dynasty for over 400 years.", "The 'Achum' shrine is the oldest surviving building in the complex.", "In 1907, the palace was burned down by German colonial troops.", "The site was added to the UNESCO tentative list in 2006.", "The annual Abin ceremony usually takes place in December.", "Bafut was an important location for British anthropological studies."],
