      hu: ["A banyói Lamidátust a 19. század elején alapították a fulbe hódítások során.", "A terület az Adamaua-fennsíkon fekszik, kedvező éghajlati adottságokkal.", "A palota bejárata az uralkodói hatalom és a védelem szimbóluma.", "A banyói uralkodó címe Lamido, aki a fulbe nép vallási vezetője is.", "A város környéke híres az állattenyésztésről, amely a Lamidátus gazdasági alapja.", "A hagyományos bírósági tárgyalásokat ma is a palota udvarán tartják."],
      ro: ["Banyo a fost un punct strategic important pe rutele comerciale trans-sahariene.", "Palatul actual păstrează elemente de design vechi de peste un secol.", "Lamidatul este renumit pentru cavalerie și măiestria călăreților săi.", "Arhitectura palatului folosește tehnici de răcire pasivă prin grosimea zidurilor.", "Ritualurile de învestire a unui nou Lamido respectă tradițiile seculare ale fulbe.", "Banyo se află la granița dintre zonele de savană și cele muntoase."],
      en: ["The Banyo Lamidat was established in the early 1800s as a Fulbe military outpost.", "The palace architecture features distinct decorative motifs unique to the Adamaoua region.", "It serves as a primary judicial center for local traditional disputes.", "The Fantasia displays are held during major Islamic holidays like Eid al-Fitr.", "The Lamidat was a significant political player during the German colonial era.", "Most of the palace structures are built using sun-dried clay and raffia thatch."],
