      en: ["The chiefdom was founded around 1750 by Noutam.", "The site is located at an altitude of approximately 1,500 meters.", "The traditional buildings are constructed using Raphia bamboo and thatch.", "The palace complex contains the tombs of 14 former kings.", "The Batoufam community museum was opened to the public in 2005.", "The protected sacred forest covers an area of more than 5 hectares."],
      es: ["Centro significativo de la tradición Bamiléké.", "Lugar importante para la estructura social y política.", "La arquitectura atestigua la identidad cultural.", "Preserva tradiciones orales de siglos de antigüedad.", "Punto de referencia importante para la historia de Batoufam.", "Símbolo del patrimonio cultural de los Bamiléké."],
